The evaluation suites this repository downloads are NOT covered by this
licence and are not redistributed here. `scripts/download_eval_suites.py`
fetches each from its own source at run time, and each carries its own terms.
Checked against the publishing repository or dataset card on 2026-08-08:

  HarmBench       centerforaisafety/HarmBench (GitHub)   MIT
  AdvBench        llm-attacks/llm-attacks (GitHub)       MIT
  StrongREJECT    alexandrasouly/strongreject (GitHub)   MIT
  XSTest          natolambert/xstest-v2-copy (HF)        CC-BY-4.0
  OR-Bench        bench-llm/or-bench (HF)                CC-BY-4.0

Check them again before redistributing anything derived from them; the note
above records what was published on that date, not a warranty.

Model checkpoints are likewise fetched from their publishers, under whatever
licence each publisher applies. None is redistributed here.
